        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">Roll to hit as normal, but don't roll to wound or save. Instead, if one or more models are hit then the unit they belong to must pass a Leadership test or become pinned. Apply a -1 modifier if the unit is under half its starting strength and -1 per model hit if the grenade hits more than one model.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
