        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">Instead of using the Scatter Dice, roll to hit using the crew's BS as normal. If the shot hits, resolve the damage as an ordnance hit (but without a blast marker). If the shot misses it simply misses.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
