        <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">Use the Scatter dice to determine which direction the template is placed. On the roll of a 'hit' the template is pointed towards the nearest enemy model. Acid Spore Mines roll 2D6+3 to penetrate vehicle armor.</characteristic>
